{"id":"verloren","lemma":"verloren","pos":"adj","rank":307,"glosses":["lost, missing","doomed, forlorn"],"ipa":"/fɛɐ̯ˈloːʁən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/20/De-verloren.ogg/De-verloren.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Alles war verloren.","en":"Everything was lost.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/87209","words":[{"g":"everything"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},null]},{"text":"Ich muss es verloren haben.","en":"I must have lost it.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/745131","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"have"}]},{"text":"Sie hat ein Buch verloren.","en":"She lost a book.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/389076","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"book (collection of…"},null]},{"text":"Du hast das Spiel verloren.","en":"You lost the game.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/393999","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"a game"},null]},{"text":"Ich habe viel Blut verloren.","en":"I lost a lot of blood.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/756267","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"much, a lot"},{"g":"blood"},null]}]}